msgid ""
"One method of using this function is to provide a single sorted row or "
"column search_array to look through for the search_key with a second "
"argument result_range. The other way is to combine these two arguments into "
"one search_array where the first row or column is searched and a value is "
"returned from the last row or column in the array. If search_key is not "
"found, a non-exact match may be returned."
msgstr ""
"Eden od načinov uporabe te funkcije je, da podate eno razvrščeno vrstico ali "
"stolpec search_array, v katerem poiščete search_key, z drugim argumentom "
"result_range. Drugi način je, da ta dva argumenta združite v en "
"search_array, v katerem se preišče prva vrstica ali stolpec in vrne vrednost "
"iz zadnje vrstice ali stolpca v matriki. Če search_key ni najden, je lahko "
"vrnjeno nepopolnoma natančno ujemanje."

